:''For other uses, see [[Hatsune Miku (disambiguation)]].''
'''Hatsune Miku''' is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 9.4 Update|Version 9.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Hatsune Miku
|image = E 500.png
|appearance = [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 4,000¢ - 15,800¢
}}

==Enemy==
She has mildly high HP, fair speed, fair attack power, and [[Weaken|weakens]] [[Cat Units]], making melee units less effective against her. Stack [[Classification#Ranger|ranged units]] like [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]] or [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Lizard Cat]] or time units like [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Swimmer Cat]] to defeat her. Any cats with the [[Long Distance|Long Distance ability]] will be helpful against her.

